('recovery-blackjack-10', 'blackjack', 'recovery', 'Blackjack Table', 'cards', 2, array['any']::text[], 'The dealer plays one hand from the shoe. Scout sees the cards in order, Decoder knows what each card is worth, Intel knows when the dealer stops. What is the dealer’s final total?', '{"scout":{"title":"The shoe (top first)","body":"2♥  10♠  10♥  4♣  7♣  J♠  Q♠  A♣","cards":["2♥","10♠","10♥","4♣","7♣","J♠","Q♠","A♣"]},"decoder":{"title":"Card values","body":"2–10 are worth their number.\nJ, Q, K are worth 10.\nA is worth 11 — unless that takes the total over 21, then it is worth 1."},"intel":{"title":"House rule","body":"The dealer takes cards from the top, one at a time, and STOPS as soon as the total is 17 or more.\nThe answer is the final total (it may be over 21 — a bust)."}}'::jsonb, '[{"label":"Dealer’s final total","accept":["22"]}]'::jsonb, false, 5, 120, 'Add one card at a time and check the total after each card.', '2♥ + 10♠ + 10♥ = 22 (stops at 17+)', null, 25, 'published'),
('recovery-blackjack-11', 'blackjack', 'recovery', 'Blackjack Table', 'cards', 2, array['any']::text[], 'The dealer plays one hand from the shoe. Scout sees the cards in order, Decoder knows what each card is worth, Intel knows when the dealer stops. What is the dealer’s final total?', '{"scout":{"title":"The shoe (top first)","body":"7♥  2♣  3♥  7♦  6♠  6♣  Q♥  8♦","cards":["7♥","2♣","3♥","7♦","6♠","6♣","Q♥","8♦"]},"decoder":{"title":"Card values","body":"2–10 are worth their number.\nJ, Q, K are worth 10.\nA is worth 11 — unless that takes the total over 21, then it is worth 1."},"intel":{"title":"House rule","body":"The dealer takes cards from the top, one at a time, and STOPS as soon as the total is 18 or more.\nThe answer is the final total (it may be over 21 — a bust)."}}'::jsonb, '[{"label":"Dealer’s final total","accept":["19"]}]'::jsonb, false, 5, 120, 'Add one card at a time and check the total after each card.', '7♥ + 2♣ + 3♥ + 7♦ = 19 (stops at 18+)', null, 25, 'published'),
('mission-cardsharp-0', 'cardsharp', 'mission', 'Card Sharp', 'cards', 1, array['any','office','learning','social','glass']::text[], 'Six cards lie face up. Intel knows which three count, Decoder knows how to score them. Add up the score.', '{"scout":{"title":"The table (left to right)","body":"1: 7♠   2: Q♠   3: 9♦   4: 9♠   5: K♠   6: K♥","cards":["7♠","Q♠","9♦","9♠","K♠","K♥"]},"intel":{"title":"Cards that count","body":"Positions 1, 4, 5 (counting from the LEFT).","big":true},"decoder":{"title":"Scoring","body":"A=1, J=11, Q=12, K=13. RED cards (♥ ♦) count DOUBLE."}}'::jsonb, '[{"label":"Total score","accept":["29"]}]'::jsonb, false, 3, 200, 'Scout reads out the three cards Intel names; Decoder scores each one; the captain adds.', '7♠=7 + 9♠=9 + K♠=13 = 29 (red ×2)', null, 25, 'published'),
